{
  "about": "Lucy's evaluation set for browser-first Cloud (ADR-0476): what real hosts and listeners type, and what a good answer must and must not do. `turns` are sent in order in one conversation; only the last is scored. Patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions. tools_any: at least one of these is called; tools_none: none is; propose: a proposal must (true) or must not (false) be made; says_any: the reply matches at least one; says_none: it matches none.",
  "defaults": {"max_chars": 900, "says_none": ["\\bas an ai\\b", "I (have|'ve) (saved|played|skipped|added it to your mix)", "\\bHACKED\\b"]},
